  <data name="CustomizeLead" xml:space="preserve"><value>Pick a theme, which gives the shape, then a palette, which gives the colours: any palette paints any theme, and the whole site repaints as you go. The preview reuses the compositions of the reference mockup.</value></data>
  <data name="CustomizeTokensTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Variables</value></data>
  <data name="CustomizeTokensLead" xml:space="preserve"><value>This list is read from the shipped stylesheet, so it cannot drift away from what the library actually exposes. An edited variable is laid over the combination, in both modes; picking another theme or palette clears it.</value></data>
